						<r3d:remarks>ADC offers a number of machine interfaces to the data catalogue. The pyCSW software is being used for this and MET contributes to development of this software. There are still some issues to resolve in the full integration with our catalogue, but services should be possible to exploit. Please contact us if you want to explore the machine interfaces, for the time being OAI-PMH, OGC CSW and OpenSearch.</r3d:remarks>
